            <ArticleTitle>Treatment of a post-traumatic headache.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>85-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>After fantasy work in a trance state a patient with post-traumatic headaches experienced some relief as other symptoms appeared, and then total relief along with the disappearance of the other symptoms. He was able to withdraw from all medications.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
